1 NAME Törner /Planck/
2 GIVN Törner
2 _MARNM Planck
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 23 APR 1679
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ronneby
3 CTRY Sweden
1 OCCU Tullkontrollör i Ronneby
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Törner var besökare (tulltjänsteman) i Ronneby då skifte efter honom hålls 18 juni 1685 i Kristianstad. De tre första barnen dog i unga år. Deras förmyndare var köpman Herman Laske i Ronneby, senare i Karlskrona. S
2 CONC ven Plancks förmyndare Lars Göransson krävde 26 januari 1683 Herman Laske på arvet efter de tre syskonen som avlidit. Brodern Johan Planck upprepade kravet 18 juni 1685. De avlidna syskonens arvslott angavs till 419 daler och 16 ö
2 CONC re smt. P.g.a. att Laske lidit ekonomisk skada genom vådelden i Ronneby 1680 jämkades beloppet till 100 daler. Lars Planck kvitterade ut sin arvedel 20 juli 1686, enligt protokoll. Källa: Släkt och hävd 1970 2-3, sid 115.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn: 
2 CONT * Johan Peter Planck (1664 - 1738)  
2 CONT *   Margareta Planck (- 1683)  
2 CONT *   Maria Planck (- 1683)  
2 CONT *   Sven Planck (- 1711)  
2 CONT *   Törner Planck (- 1683)  
2 CONT *   Lars Planck (- 1709) 
2 CONT
2 CONT "Törner was noted as a customs examinant in the city of Ronneby according to the record of distribution after his death in 18th of June 1685 in the city of Kristianstad. All the first three children died at an early age. Their's g
2 CONC uardian was the merchant Herman Laske in the city of Ronnyby, later in the city of Karlskrona. In 26th of January 1683, Sven Planck's guardian, Lars Jöransson, claimed Herman Laske the share of the inheritance at after Svens broth
2 CONC er and two sisters. The brother Johan Planck repeated the claime in 18th of June 1685. The part of the inheritance at from them was state d to 419 daler and 16 öre. Because of that Laske had suffered economically as a result of "t
2 CONC he accidental fire" in Ronneby in 1680 the amount adjusted to 100 daler. Lars Planck was signed for his share of inheritance in 20th of July 1686." Source: Släkt och hävd 1970 2-3, page 115.  http://hem.passagen.se/sven.planck/Htm
2 CONC l_farfarEng/pcd5c0394.html''''''
