1 NAME Metta Larsdotter /Hartman/
2 GIVN Metta Larsdotter
2 SURN Hartman
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 FEB 1670
2 PLAC Lund
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 APR 1752
2 PLAC Malmö Fosie
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.tjocka.nu/heritage/i365.htm#i201
2 CONT
2 CONT Begravning: 16 Maj 1752 - Fosie, Malmöhus län, Sverige
2 CONT
2 CONT !BIRTH: Complete date 17 Feb 1670, based on age given on death rec.
2 CONT
2 CONT MARR #1: Pastor Hans Flensburg, Fosie parish reg FHL #145123 (he d 1709).
2 CONT
2 CONT MARR #2: Pastor Hans Lorich, Fosie parish reg FHL #145123.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH-BURIAL: Fosie parish reg FHL #145123 pg 166, "16 May 1752 the Pastors
2 CONT
2 CONT widow, Mätta Hartman was buried in the Fosie church under the altar with her
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st dear husband who was the minister with these parishes & was well-born and
2 CONT
2 CONT well-lived. She died 30 April which was Ascesion day at 2 in the afternoon at
2 CONT
2 CONT the Malmö hospital, age 82 yrs 2 mons & 13 days of a wasteing away fever, it
2 CONT
2 CONT was hard for her to breathe & had a headache, also problems with her blood. Her
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd husband, who was also a fine man is buried at the right side of the altar".
2 CONT
2 CONT PROBATE: Malmö probate FHL #146518 pg 1163 No 2407, dated 13 Jul 1752.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCE #2: 2nd hubs biog FHL #1440047, vol 2, pg 360, #11.
