1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 💙 Ernst Reinhold Starck is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Ernst-Reinhold-Starck?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000004667372280 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 8th great grandso
2 CONC n.
