1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The merchants in the province Skåne established firm business relations with agents abroad. Jeppe Pihl's agent was the powerful Dutchman Arent Simonsson van Deurs, who had extensive business relations in Sweden and
2 CONC  Denmark. His granddaughter Jannika van Deurs married Peter Prael, merchant in Kristianstad, in her first marriage. The second time around was with Michael Broomé, and their daughters married a couple of Cöster brothers, as mentio
2 CONC ned above. Thus she became an ancestress to the Cöster family. Throughout her life she maintained vivid family relations to her Dutch background in Arnheim and Gelderland. She also ended up with a considerable inherited fortune. T
2 CONC he Cösters seem to also have inherited a powerful foreign agent.
2 CONT
2 CONT The van Deurs Coat of Arms can be found on Jannika van Deur's tombstone in Kristianstad, as well as in the Hirsch Collection in Copenhagen, relating to Jacob Christian van Deurs at the Falster's Enlisted Infantry Regiment. Denmark
2 CONC  knows the van Deurs family as well as Sweden.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Jannika och Michael hade tre barn tillsammans.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jannikas farfar kom från Holland.
