2 CONT * Siblings:	Olof Aulin, Lovisa Catharina Darin (born Aulin), Kristina Katharina Darin (born Aulin), Maria Maja Landgren (born Aulin), Sven Aulin, Johan Aulin, Gustaf Herman Aulin, Margaretha Aulin, Jöns Aulin, Johanna Maria Aulin,
