1 NAME Hack /Söffrensen/ i Fulltofta
2 GIVN Hack
2 NSFX i Fulltofta
2 _MARNM Söffrensen
2 NICK Håkan
2 NICK Sörensson
2 NICK Schougård
2 NICK Skovgaard
2 NICK Skougardt
2 NICK Skougård
2 NICK Schougaard
2 NICK Skogård
2 NICK Schogård
1 SEX M
