1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Catharina Larsdotter född i Lyrestad/R. Dotter till bonden Lars Svensson och Ingeborg Ambjörnsdotter samt syster till biskopen i Västerås Olof Laurelius.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Skraggensk%C3%B6ld_nr_552 Skraggensköld no. 552, by Adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 4'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Olaus Simonis Skragge born in the early 1570s probably in Hammarö/S, † 1633.''' Chaplain in Karlstad around 1600. Parish priest in Holmedal pastorate of Karlstad diocese 1620. '''Married 1st to Catharina Larsdotter born in Lyre
2 CONC stad/R. Daughter of farmer Lars Svensson and Ingeborg Ambjörnsdotter and sister of the bishop of Västerås Olof Laurelius . Married 2nd in 1621 to Helena or Elin Johansdotter born in the early 1570s, † around 1633. Her 1st married 
2 CONC the parish priest in Sunne Laurentius Birgeri Victorius born in Bråte, Segerstad/R, † spring 1626 in Fryksdalen. Her 3rd married the parish priest Brynolphus Thomae Cygnaeus , † 1658.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children from 1st marriage with Catharina Larsdotter:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Simon Olofsson Skragge''' ennobled Skraggensköld born around 1608, † 1673. See Tab.8
2 CONT * '''Sven Olofsson Skragge ,''' † 1646. Land rent master. See Tab. 9.
2 CONT * '''Karin Olofsdotter Skragge .''' Married to H. Jesperi in Mätzewijk who is probably the vicar in Millesvik Jesperi Thorstani Ek , † 1655-01-01.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children from 2nd marriage with Helena or Elin Johansdotter:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Johan Olofsson Skragge''' born 1622 in Holmedal, † 1682 in Jösse/S. See Tab. 10. See: Skragge
2 CONT * '''Karin Olofsdotter Skragge .''' Married in 1647 to the lecturer in Karlstad and the vicar in Grava Andreas Petri Hofflandus, born about 1598 in Hovlanda, Hammarö/S, † 80 years old in 1678.
2 CONT * '''Anna Maria Olofsdotter Skragge''' born 1625. Married in 1645 to Major Anders Fraser the Elder born 1616, † 1686. His 2nd marriage was to Catarina Skraggensköld born 1645, † 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 1'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Simon Svensson Skragge .''' Came from Norway into Värmland at the end of King Gustaf I's time and lived at Hammarö. '''Married after 1557 to a daughter of the parish priest Laurentius Laurentii in Tingvalla (now Karlstad), late
2 CONC r in Nor, who died in 1567 and whose widow then lived in Hammarö. They had five sons.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Simon Simonsson Skragge .''' Master Mason. Lived in 1590 in Ugglesäter in Huggenäs parish/S. Was 1600 sheriff in Näs district. Concluded settlement with Björn Jönsson in Glumserud regarding his and his siblings' inheritance i
2 CONC n Glumserud.
2 CONT * '''Lars Simonsson Skragge''' See Skraggenstjerna
2 CONT * '''Måns Simonsson Skragge .''' Peasant. Farmer at Hammarö.
2 CONT * '''Olaus Simonis Skragge .''' Vicar. Died 1633. born in the early 1570s probably in Hammarö/S, † 1633. Chaplain in Karlstad around 1600. Church priest in Holmedal's pastorate of the Karlstad diocese in 1620. '''Married 1st to Ca
2 CONC tharina Larsdotter born in Lyrestad/R. Daughter of the farmer Lars Svensson and Ingeborg Ambjörnsdotter and sister of the bishop of Västerås Olof Laurelius . Married 2nd in 1621 to Helena or Elin Johansdotter born in the early 157
2 CONC 0s, † around 1633. Her 1st married the parish priest in Sunne Laurentius Birgeri Victorius born in Bråte, Segerstad/R, † spring 1626 in Fryksdalen. Her 3rd married vicar Brynolphus Thomae Cygnaeus , † 1658.
2 CONT * '''Sven Simonsson Skragge .''' He carries the Skragge Family Coat Arms'''
2 CONT * '''Anders Simonsson Skragge,''' A new branch of the Skragge family, By Christian Juliusson and Carl-Johan. On Christmas Eve 1709, Anders Simonsson died in Västra Sälboda, Gunnarskog parish, at the age of 85. According to the dea
2 CONC th certificate, he was born in Västra Uggelsäter, Huggenäs parish. This fact – and the fact that several of his children and grandchildren, as early as the 1680s, adopted the name Skragge – has led to extensive investigations and 
2 CONC speculation about his possible relationship with the famous Värmland family Skragge.
